ues and collaborators who have shaped my thinking about algorithmic trading over many years. I am grateful to my team at BBVA for the daily conversations that have refined the ideas in these pages and for their patience in reading early drafts. Their questions are the origin of many of the derivations and examples in this book.","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1},"end":{"line":53,"column":1}},"key":"yJE1QXEzzy"}],"key":"KIjCnMfEbb"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"I also thank the many readers who have taken the time to file issues and suggestions through the GitHub repository. A living book improves through its readers, and their engagement has made this a better work.","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"key":"pY6ZR3ejcK"}],"key":"oBlRhfMcAd"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":57,"column":1},"end":{"line":57,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Finally, I am indebted to my family for their continued support, which makes this project possible.","position":{"start":{"line":57,"column":1},"end":{"line":57,"column":1}},"key":"si1Ecviw4u"}],"key":"gCTpZqCYuW"}],"key":"fR65JOD2I5"}],"key":"htpAmgUapH"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"Dedication","url":"/markdown/dedication","group":"Introduction"},"next":{"title":"Symbols","url":"/markdown/symbollist","group":"Introduction"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3000"}